<title>USA: Equity registers 7.99 million shr offer.</title>
<headline>Equity registers 7.99 million shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Corp International said on Monday it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in connection with a 7.99 million share offering by stockholder Service Corp International.</p>
<p>The registration statement also covered 1.2 million common stock the company might issue upon exercise of an over-allotment option it granted to underwriters.</p>
<p>Equity said it expected the proposed sale would start in January. Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, The Chicago Cop, J.P. Morgan &amp; Co and Raymond James &amp; Associates Inc would be managing underwriters, the company said.</p>
